<title>GERMANY: Colonia 96 life premium income down 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Colonia 96 life premium income down 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group life insurance premium income    2,900   vs 3,300</p>
<p>    --Colonia Lebensversicherung AG	  1,400   vs 1,900</p>
<p>    --Nordstern Lebensversicherung AG	1,500   vs 1,400</p>
<p>Colonia Lebensversicherung AG net profit 11.8  vs 10.3</p>
<p>Nordstern Lebensversicherung AG net profit 15.5 vs 18.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German insurer is Colonia Konzern AG. Colonia Lebensversicherung AG and Nordstern Lebensversicherung AG are the group's two life insurance subsidiaries.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
